{"total": 39.65, "frases": [{"k": "hook", "t0": 0.05, "t1": 2.665, "txt": "Your dog isn't being dramatic on New Year's Eve."}, {"k": "ears", "t0": 2.765, "t1": 5.988, "txt": "To his ears, every firework sounds like the sky is breaking."}, {"k": "hear", "t0": 6.048, "t1": 7.814, "txt": "He picks up sounds you can't even hear."}, {"k": "signs", "t0": 7.914, "t1": 11.008, "txt": "So he shakes. He hides. He pants. He tries to run."}, {"k": "study", "t0": 11.128, "t1": 13.412, "txt": "Researchers asked thousands of dog owners."}, {"k": "half", "t0": 13.452, "t1": 16.942, "txt": "About half said their dog shows fear of loud noises like fireworks."}, {"k": "good", "t0": 17.082, "t1": 19.07, "txt": "Here's the good news: there's still time."}, {"k": "play", "t0": 19.169, "t1": 23.453, "txt": "Starting now, play firework sounds very quietly while he eats his favorite treat."}, {"k": "louder", "t0": 23.533, "t1": 26.972, "txt": "A little louder every day. Never so loud that he stops eating."}, {"k": "den", "t0": 27.072, "t1": 29.507, "txt": "Build him a cozy den, away from the windows."}, {"k": "night", "t0": 29.607, "t1": 31.766, "txt": "And on the night, it's okay to comfort him."}, {"k": "worse", "t0": 31.826, "t1": 33.09, "txt": "You won't make the fear worse."}, {"k": "couch", "t0": 33.21, "t1": 36.404, "txt": "So when midnight comes, he's on the couch with you. Not hiding."}, {"k": "cta", "t0": 36.524, "t1": 39.054, "txt": "Send this to someone whose dog hates fireworks."}], "palavras": [{"w": "Your", "t0": 0.08, "t1": 0.343, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "dog", "t0": 0.343, "t1": 0.562, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "isn't", "t0": 0.562, "t1": 0.868, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "being", "t0": 0.868, "t1": 1.174, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "dramatic", "t0": 1.174, "t1": 1.612, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "on", "t0": 1.612, "t1": 1.787, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "New", "t0": 1.787, "t1": 2.006, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "Year's", "t0": 2.006, "t1": 2.356, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "Eve.", "t0": 2.356, "t1": 2.575, "k": "hook"}, {"